          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Efron won oyido obedo i dier Johiti i karomo, aka odwoko Abraham munyo ji jowinjo ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Winji jadwoŋ, amiyin ndelo kiri gi ŋungu ma nitie iye; ruwaŋ ji paran won amiyin ŋey inyal yiko dhako perin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Abraham okule piny ruwaŋ Johiti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka owaco ri Efron munyo kisi nyatoro je winjo ni, “Akwayin, mondo winjan ye; alanyewo ndelo gipi. Riameno jol cul paran, aka ayiki dhako paran kenyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efron odwoko Abraham ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jadwoŋ, adec lowo ma romo nyaka feza miya aŋwen bende ginaŋo i dier an kodin! Yik dhako perin i iye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham oyere gi Efron, aka opima ri Efron feza m'oyido go otieko waco munyo kisi nyatoro je winjo kodi rapim ma jomitan oyido jo oro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno apaka ndelo pa Efron m'oyido nitie i Makipela, yuwok ceŋ ma Mamire, kodi ŋungu m'oyido nitie iye, kiri gi yen olokere ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lim pa Abraham ruwaŋ Johiti, kodi ruwaŋ ji ma jokidho i waŋkac ma tindi je ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma gime Abraham oyiko cege i ŋungu ma ndelo ma Makipela yuwok ceŋ ma Mamire i piny Kanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno ndelo m'oyido obedo apa Johiti, gi ŋungu m'oyido nitie iye olokere lim pa Abraham paka kayik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
